OL,3,AParrot eggs hatch after suspected Thai
OL,4,Asmuggler arrested at South African
OL,5,Aairport
OL,6,
OL,7,FFifty eggs suspected to be those of
OL,8,Fendangered parrots were intercepted at
OL,9,FSouth Africa's main airport in
OL,10,FJohannesburg last Thursday - and some
OL,11,Fof them have now hatched.
OL,13,FA 50-year-old Thai national was
OL,14,Farrested for allegedly attempting to
OL,15,Fsmuggle them in a "homemade incubator
OL,16,Fbag" carried as hand luggage, according
OL,17,Fto the Department of Forestry,
OL,18,FFisheries and the Environment (DFFE).
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
