OL,3,AParrot eggs hatch after suspected Thai
OL,4,Asmuggler arrested at South African
OL,5,Aairport
OL,6,
OL,7,FMany of the rescued eggs have
OL,8,Fsuccessfully hatched, with the chicks
OL,9,Fnow receiving "intensive" care to
OL,10,F"maximise their chances of survival",
OL,11,Fit added.
OL,13,FIf convicted, the suspected wildlife
OL,14,Ftrafficker faces a fine of up to 10m
OL,15,Frand ($626,000, #461,000) or up to 10
OL,16,Fyears in prison, or both.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
